    <sys:String xmlns:sys="clr-namespace:System;assembly=System.Runtime" x:Key="Prompt.Info1">GeniaFirewall 0.7.4 RC1 groups simultaneous destinations from one EXE into a single prompt. Reverse DNS may be shown for TCP, but the rule still applies to the application, not the host name.</sys:String>
    <sys:String xmlns:sys="clr-namespace:System;assembly=System.Runtime" x:Key="Prompt.Info2">In WFP Normal mode, the application stays quarantined while a decision is pending. Later and closing this window keep network access blocked.</sys:String>
