    <sys:String xmlns:sys="clr-namespace:System;assembly=System.Runtime" x:Key="Settings.ExportImport.Info">Rules, SHA-256 values and behavioral settings are stored in JSON. Backend, service state, autostart and window placement are not transferred.</sys:String>
